-- ============================================================================
-- DR4 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Well Control, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: the limit at the casing shoe. MAASP as the fracture
-- pressure there less the mud column above it, which makes it a ROCK limit at
-- a stated mud weight and means it FALLS as the mud weight rises. Kick
-- tolerance as two cases, shut in at the bottom and circulated to just below
-- the shoe with Boyle compression back to the entry volume, with the smaller
-- reported. Boyle on a single continuous bubble, conservative for a dispersed
-- influx and badly wrong for dissolved gas in oil-based mud, with the
-- isothermal and ideal assumptions erring in opposite directions and partly
-- cancelling. The sweep against mud weight, which sets the casing point.
--
-- THE FINDING THIS TIER IS BUILT ON, WHICH THE SWEEP PRODUCED RATHER THAN THE
-- PLAN. The slant well's kick tolerance falls nearly linearly from 7.814 m3 at
-- 1200 kg/m3 to zero at 1680. The horizontal well's is FLAT: 1.0776682353801654
-- at 1200 and 1.0792753276402405 at 1560, a RISE of two parts in a thousand
-- over 360 kg/m3 of mud weight. Its binding case is the circulated one, and
-- that case is limited by the 42.515647195 m of true vertical rise between its
-- bit and its shoe rather than by pressure. The distance does not move with
-- the mud weight, so neither does the tolerance. The usual well design lever
-- does not work on the well that needs it most, and module 4 says so.
--
-- FIVE THINGS TAUGHT IN m05 AND CERTIFIED NOWHERE: subsea and floating
-- operations, gas migration and volumetric control, dissolved gas in
-- oil-based mud, the casing pressure history, and multiphase influx
-- behaviour. 20260830_dr4_wellcontrol_go_live.sql asserts that no graded field
-- key names any of them.
--
-- Answer keys live only here and in academy_quiz_questions, which has no
-- client SELECT policy.
-- ============================================================================

